<title>DUBAI: Saudi riyal interbank deposits mainly steady.</title>
<headline>Saudi riyal interbank deposits mainly steady.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi riyal interbank deposits were mainly steady in the week to Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>One- and three-month deposits were flat at a previous 5-1/2, 3/8 percent and 5-9/16, 7/16 respectively.</p>
<p>Six-month funds were at 5-5/8, 1/2 from 5-11/16, 9/16. One-year deposits were at 5-3/4, 5/8 from 5-13/16, 11/16.</p>
<p>The spot Saudi riyal was stable on the dollar at 3.7503/7.</p>
</text>
